					"兰百梨迦"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730161001,
					"content": "好像…好像都是坏掉的？都不会动欸！吓、吓死我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161002,
					"content": "哼哼，什么嘛，不就是些生锈的铁块而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161003,
					"content": "现在的桓那是危险的桓那，派蒙大意，会吃大亏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161004,
					"content": "唔…兰百梨迦好严格哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161005,
					"content": "是派蒙太散漫了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161006,
					"content": "是这样吗？那…那我也像兰百梨迦那样严格的话，也能像他一样强吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161007,
					"content": "派蒙应该对自己严格而不是对别人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161008
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161008,
					"content": "好哦，那就从明天开始对自己严格要求吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161009,
					"content": "总之，既然石头的「枝」就在这里，接下来只要…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161010,
					"content": "找到三个石头都朝向这里就可以了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161011,
					"content": "被、被抢答了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161012,
					"content": "说起来，兰百梨迦的说话风格和兰般度差好多，完全不会用比喻。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161013,
						730161015
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161013,
					"content": "不过这样更好懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161014
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161014,
					"content": "直来直去确实很明白呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161017,
					"content": "因为兰般度想很多，兰百梨迦想很少。我只懂保护。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161018,
					"content": "兰般度曾经和那菈法留纳一起保护桓那，他们一起赶走了黑色的不祥的污泥，治好了法留纳神机。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161019
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161019,
					"content": "#那菈法留纳离开桓那已经很久，无忧节，{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}或许也不会来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161020
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161020,
					"content": "兰般度一定知道。已经不知道过去了多久，时间足够一粒种子长成参天大树，离开桓那的那菈不会再回来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161021
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161021,
					"content": "但是兰般度想要又一次治好法留纳神机，为了桓那，为了无忧节，也为那菈法留纳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161022
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161022,
					"content": "原来是这样…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161023
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161023,
					"content": "#兰百梨迦没有见过那菈法留纳，但是{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}的事，桓那知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161024
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161024,
					"content": "兰百梨迦不会像兰般度一样想很多，只知道，兰百梨迦足够强，可以保护兰那罗，也可以保护桓那。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161025
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161025,
					"content": "那菈法留纳不在了，兰那罗也可以治好法留纳神机。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161026
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161026,
					"content": "#嗯！而且还有我和{NICKNAME}帮忙呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161027
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161027,
					"content": "#这里的铁的味道，不对劲。那菈{NICKNAME}，就交给你了。我在这里等你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161028
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161028,
					"content": "不知道兰百梨迦感知到了什么…不过森林的事情，兰那罗肯定知道得更清楚吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161029
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161029,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，总之，我们在附近找找三个分散的「叶」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161015,
					"content": "有点不像兰那罗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161016
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161016,
					"content": "不过，什么才叫「像兰那罗」呢？唔…搞不懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161017
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
