			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730161501,
					"content": "呼…真的吓到了，幸好有兰百梨迦帮忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161502,
					"content": "早说过，派蒙大意，会吃大亏。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161503,
					"content": "唔…我知道错啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161504,
					"content": "遗迹里有守卫，那就一定是会动的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161505,
					"content": "说的也是，这就叫「名副其实」吗？毕竟对它们来说，我们才是外来者呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161506,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙是桓那的外来者，兰百梨迦不是，所以是大大铁块不懂道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161507,
					"content": "大大铁块不懂道理，兰百梨迦就让它懂道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰百梨迦"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161508,
					"content": "呜…派蒙会当懂道理的好孩子的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161509,
					"content": "派蒙要说话算话哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730161510,
					"content": "那当然啦！明天…不，现在就开始！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730161511,
					"content": "#这里的石头，只有兰那罗才能唤醒它。那菈{NICKNAME}和派蒙，之后就交给兰百梨迦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730161512
